    "correctAnswer": 1,
    "explanation": "To move up with acceleration \ud835\udc4e, themonkey will, push the rope downwards with a force of \ud835\udc47min = \ud835\udc5a\ud835\udc54+ 40 \ud835\udc4emax;600 = 400 + 40 \ud835\udc4emax \ud835\udc4emax = 200 40 5 ms\u22122 So rope will break if the monkey climbs up with acceleration 6 ms\u22122",
