    "questionText": "A plank is held at an angle \ud835\udefc to the horizontal on two fixed supports \ud835\udc34 and\ud835\udc35. The plank can slide against the supports (without friction) because of the weight\ud835\udc40g sin\ud835\udefc. Acceleration and direction in which a man of mass \ud835\udc5a should move so that the plank does not move are",
