    "questionText": "Blocks \ud835\udc34 and \ud835\udc35 in the figure are connected by a bar of negligible weight. Mass of each block is 17 kg and \ud835\udf07\ud835\udc34= 0.2 and \ud835\udf07\ud835\udc35= 0.4, where \ud835\udf07\ud835\udc34 and \ud835\udf07\ud835\udc35 are the coefficients of limiting friction between blocks and plane, calculate the force developed in the bar (g=10 ms\u22122)",
