    "subtopic": "Newton's Laws & Friction",
    "difficulty": "Hard",
    "questionText": "A 10 kg block is placed on top of 40 kg block as shown. A horizontal force \ud835\udc39 acting on \ud835\udc35 causes an acceleration of 2 ms\u22122 to\ud835\udc35. For this situations mark out the correct statement(s)",
