    "subtopic": "Newton's Laws & Friction",
    "difficulty": "Hard",
    "questionText": "Two blocks of masses \ud835\udc5a1 and \ud835\udc5a2 are connected through a massless inextensible string. Block of mass \ud835\udc5a1 is placed at the fixed rigid inclined surface while the block of mass \ud835\udc5a2 hanging at the other end of the string, which is passing through a fixed massless frictionless pulley shown in the figure. The coefficient of static friction between the block and the inclined plane is 0.8. the system of masses \ud835\udc5a1 and \ud835\udc5a2 is released from rest",
